icbm.complex.book.manual.general=Site Orientation|Base Command|Welcome to the complex. You are now about forty meters under the surface. The air is filtered and the water is recycled; waste neither.~Learn the way to the escape ladder on your first day. Walk it with your eyes shut on your second.~Sirens: one long tone means drill, three short tones mean shelter in place, and a steady wail means go topside.
icbm.complex.book.manual.food=Galley Handbook|Chief Cook Price|Feed the crew on time, every time. Breakfast at 0600, lunch at 1200, supper at 1800. A hungry watch is a careless watch.~Keep the cold room shut. Rotate the stock: oldest cans to the front. Anything that smells wrong goes to the incinerator, not the pot.~Wash every pan the same shift you use it. Grease fire: lid on, burner off, never water.
icbm.complex.book.manual.crew=Crew Quarters Rules|Sgt. Hale|Lights out at 2300. Quiet hours run until 0530. Radios stay off in the bunks.~Beds made, lockers shut, boots under the bunk. No food in quarters: the rats down here are bold.~Report every cough to the medic. One sick crew member becomes ten in a week underground.
icbm.complex.book.manual.arms=Small Arms Manual|Armorer Novak|Every weapon is loaded until you prove otherwise. Keep your finger off the trigger and the muzzle in a safe direction.~Clean after every range day. Oil lightly: a dry bolt sticks and a wet one gathers grit.~Sign weapons out and back in. A missing rifle locks the whole complex down until it turns up.
icbm.complex.book.manual.missile=Missile Assembly Guide|Eng. Lindqvist|Assemble in this order: body, fins, harness, guidance, warhead last. Never fit a warhead to a body that has not passed its checks.~Ground yourself before you touch the harness. Static has ruined more guidance boards than any drop.~Two people sign every tag. If you work alone, you are not working; you are breaking the rules.
icbm.complex.book.manual.command=Launch Control Procedures|Lt. Mercer|A launch takes two officers, two keys and a confirmed order. Without all three the panel stays dark.~Check the silo status lights at the start of each watch. Amber means a fault: log it and call the shaft crew.~Report radar contacts at once. Do not guess. Do not assume a drill.
icbm.complex.book.manual.works=Plant Maintenance Manual|Chief Eng. Ortiz|Rounds every four hours: pumps, fans, generators, filters. Write down every reading, even the boring ones.~Lockout and tagout before any repair. The machine you trust is the one that takes your hand.~When a pump sings, it is starving for water. Shut it down before it seizes.
icbm.complex.book.manual.stores=Stores Procedures|QM Reyes|Everything that comes in gets a tag and a line in the ledger. Everything that goes out gets a signature.~Heavy crates low, light crates high, labels facing out. Keep the aisles clear for the forklift.~Count the stock every Monday. Report a short count the same day.
icbm.complex.book.note.staffed.1=Shift Notes|Cpl. Walsh|Quiet watch. Radar showed geese again. Coffee machine fixed, finally. Somebody keeps taking the good chair.
icbm.complex.book.note.staffed.2=Reminder|Sgt. Hale|Inspection Friday. I want the floors clean enough to eat off and the rifles cleaner than that.
icbm.complex.book.note.staffed.3=Letter Home|Pvt. Kimura|Dear Mom, the food is fine and the work is steady. I can't say where I am, but it is warm and dry. Send socks.
icbm.complex.book.note.in_service.1=Staffing|Lt. Mercer|Half the crew rotated out and nobody replaced them. We keep the lit rooms running and close the rest.
icbm.complex.book.note.in_service.2=Rounds|Sgt. Adeyemi|Walked the dark wing. Doors shut, nothing moving. Kept the lights off to save the generators.
icbm.complex.book.note.in_service.3=Supply Note|QM Reyes|Deliveries come every other month now. Ration the coffee. Ration everything.
icbm.complex.book.note.mothballed.1=Closing Notes|Chief Eng. Ortiz|Room shut down per orders. Breakers off, valves closed, covers on. Do not restart anything without me.
icbm.complex.book.note.mothballed.2=Standby|Lt. Mercer|This section is mothballed until further notice. Check it monthly for leaks and pests.
icbm.complex.book.note.mothballed.3=Inventory|QM Reyes|Stock left in place. The count may be short. Nobody wants to sign for a dark room.
icbm.complex.book.note.gutted.1=Final Entry|Unknown|Day 41. No supply run. No word from command. We are taking the rifles and the water and going topside at dawn.
icbm.complex.book.note.gutted.2=To Whoever Finds This|Cpl. Walsh|We stripped what we could carry. The rest is yours. The east pump still works if you kick it.
icbm.complex.book.note.gutted.3=Last Watch|Sgt. Hale|Power is failing room by room. I counted the crew this morning. Six. Yesterday there were nine.
icbm.complex.book.note.gutted.4=Note|Pvt. Kimura|Mom, if this ever reaches you: I am going north with the others. Do not wait up.
